WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.270
What happens when you put numbers into letters?

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:06.020
Take v = u + a t.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:10.710
u is 3, a is 2, t is 5.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.500
Swap them in: 3 + 2 × 5.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.370
Multiply first: 10.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.170
Add 3.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:21.013
v is 13.
